  "約西元1500年・南大洋": "Around AD 1500 · Southern Ocean",
  "你是坎貝爾島周邊海域的一隻成年南方皇家信天翁。此為非育雛時段的虛構行程，並不重建古代航線。": "You are an adult southern royal albatross in waters around Campbell Island. This fictional journey outside chick rearing reconstructs no ancient route.",
