  "約西元1500年・婆羅洲": "Around AD 1500 · Borneo",
  "你是一隻獨立生活的成年婆羅洲紅毛猩猩。果食、謹慎攀爬與築巢取材自自然史，沒有指定當代保護區。": "You are an independent adult Bornean orangutan. Fruit feeding, careful climbing and nest building draw on natural history without placing a modern reserve in the past.",
